{
    "version": "4.43.0",
    "description": "网易UU远程（GameViewer）：超低延迟的远程控制工具，支持 Windows / macOS / iOS / Android / TV",
    "homepage": "https://uuyc.163.com/",
    "license": "Freeware",
    "url": "https://api.nrd.nie.163.com/api/v1/release/dl/1?channel=gwqd#/uuyc-setup.exe",
    "hash": "sha256:f26f84f01551538b9f6996d5cf0ccbf884fb12731903a4f3efa73be712c44da4",
    "pre_install": [
        "Expand-7zipArchive (Get-ChildItem \"$dir\\*.exe\" | Select-Object -First 1).FullName \"$dir\\_extract\"",
        "$sub = Get-ChildItem \"$dir\\_extract\" -Directory | Where-Object { $_.Name -like '*37*' } | Select-Object -First 1",
        "if ($sub) { Move-Item \"$($sub.FullName)\\*\" \"$dir\" -Force } else { Move-Item \"$dir\\_extract\\*\" \"$dir\" -Force }",
        "Remove-Item \"$dir\\_extract\" -Recurse -Force"
    ],
    "bin": "GameViewer.exe",
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "GameViewer.exe",
            "网易UU远程"
        ]
    ],
    "checkver": {
        "script": [
            "$h = (& curl.exe -sI --max-time 20 -H 'Referer: https://uuyc.163.com/download/' 'https://api.nrd.nie.163.com/api/v1/release/dl/1?channel=gwqd') -join \"`n\"",
            "if ($h -match 'location:.*UURemote_Setup_([\\d.]+)\\.') { Write-Output $Matches[1] }"
        ]
    },
    "autoupdate": {
        "url": "https://api.nrd.nie.163.com/api/v1/release/dl/1?channel=gwqd#/uuyc-setup.exe"
    },
    "notes": [
        "免安装便携版：NSIS 安装包用 7z 解包后拍平载荷目录（$dir 根为程序本体，主程序 GameViewer.exe）。",
        "自动更新：url 指向官方下载 API（302 到最新稳定版安装包），checkver 从 302 的 Location 中解析版本号；页面显示的灰度版本可能领先于 API。"
    ]
}
